  ],
  "status": "stable",
  "added": "2026-10-29",
  "notes": "Core ActivityStreams 2.0 property, present on virtually every ActivityPub activity. The value is typically a Person, Application, Group, Organization or Service (AS2 has no Actor class — \"actor\" is a role, not a type). Use `urn:solid:attributedTo` for the author of a content object (a Note, Article); use `actor` for who performed an activity.",
  "examples": [
    {
